    <bpmn:process id="W_W4457" name="W4457. Drug-Free Workplace Strategy, Policy &amp; Operating Model" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: DOLE requirement; policy review; incident
Frequency: Annual + on regulatory/incident change
Volume: One enterprise drug-free workplace program across 5 entities
Owner: HR (VS-19/VS-103) / HSE (VS-24) / Compliance (VS-22)
Participants: HR (VS-103), HSE (VS-24), Compliance (VS-22), Legal (VS-100), Occupational Health (VS-83), Labor Relations (VS-84), Security (VS-23)
Source: workflow W4457 — Drug-Free Workplace Strategy, Policy &amp; Operating Model</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4457_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4457_Lane1" name="HR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4457_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4457_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4457_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4457_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4457_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4457_Start3" name="DOLE requirement; policy review; incident">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4457_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4457_Task4" name="HR/HSE/Compliance set the drug-free strategy &amp; policy — objectives (safety…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: HR/HSE/Compliance set the drug-free strategy &amp; policy — objectives (safety, legal compliance, deterrence, rehabilitation), scope (all entities/sites/roles incl. safety-sensitive), and the prevention-vs-punishment balance (DOLE rehabilitation emphasis)
Responsible (R): HR / HSE / Compliance
Accountable (A): CHRO / COO / Compliance Lead
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4457_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4457_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4457_Task5" name="HR/Legal draft the written policy (required by D.O. 53-03) — prohibited…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: HR/Legal draft the written policy (required by D.O. 53-03) — prohibited conduct, testing types &amp; circumstances, consequences, rehabilitation pathway, confidentiality, due process — and align with the CBA/handbook (VS-84)
Responsible (R): HR / Legal / Labor Relations
Accountable (A): CHRO / VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4457_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4457_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4457_Task6" name="HR/Compliance cascade the policy to all employees (acknowledgement), embed in…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: HR/Compliance cascade the policy to all employees (acknowledgement), embed in onboarding/handbook (VS-19), and review on regulatory/incident change
Responsible (R): HR / Compliance / L&amp;D
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4457_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4457_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4457_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4457_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4457_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-129 (ensure drug-free workplace program compliance.) | - CTL-680: written DOLE-aligned policy; scope all entities/roles; rehabilitation pathway; acknowledged by all employees; reviewed annually
Owner: HR (VS-19/VS-103) / HSE (VS-24) / Compliance (VS-22)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4457_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4457_Annotation8" targetRef="W4457_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
