    <bpmn:process id="W_W4458" name="W4458. DOLE D.O. 53-03 &amp; PH Regulatory Framework Alignment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Policy (W4457); regulatory change; DOLE inspection
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: One regulatory-alignment framework
Owner: Compliance (VS-22) / HR / Legal (VS-100)
Participants: Compliance (VS-22), HR (VS-103), Legal (VS-100), HSE (VS-24), Occupational Health (VS-83), DOLE/Liaison (VS-104)
Source: workflow W4458 — DOLE D.O. 53-03 &amp; PH Regulatory Framework Alignment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4458_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4458_Lane1" name="Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4458_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4458_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4458_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4458_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4458_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4458_Start3" name="Policy (W4457); regulatory change; DOLE inspection">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4458_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4458_Task4" name="Compliance/Legal map the regulatory framework — DOLE D.O. 53-03 (drug-free…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Compliance/Legal map the regulatory framework — DOLE D.O. 53-03 (drug-free workplace policy/program), RA 9165 Art. V (employer obligation &amp; officer liability), DOH A.O. (accredited drug-testing labs/MRO), LTFRB/DOTr (driver testing), and DOLE D.O. on workplace safety
Responsible (R): Compliance / Legal / HR
Accountable (A): Compliance Lead / VP Legal
Duration: Annual + on change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4458_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4458_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4458_Task5" name="Compliance/HR translate regulations into the policy (W4457), the testing matrix…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Compliance/HR translate regulations into the policy (W4457), the testing matrix (W4465–W4468), vendor accreditation (W4460), and DOLE documentation (W4477)
Responsible (R): Compliance / HR / HSE
Accountable (A): Compliance Lead / CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4458_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4458_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4458_Task6" name="Compliance/Legal monitor regulatory change, manage DOLE inspection (W4477), and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Compliance/Legal monitor regulatory change, manage DOLE inspection (W4477), and report to governance (VS-36/W4480)
Responsible (R): Compliance / Legal / HR
Accountable (A): Compliance Lead / VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4458_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4458_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4458_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4458_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4458_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-129 (ensure drug-free workplace program compliance.) | - CTL-680: regulatory framework mapped; policy/program aligned; labs/MRO DOH-accredited; DOLE documentation ready (W4477)
Owner: Compliance (VS-22) / HR / Legal (VS-100)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
