    <bpmn:process id="W_W4460" name="W4460. Drug Testing Vendor (Collection/Lab/MRO) Selection &amp; Contract" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor contracting; renewal; underperformance
Frequency: Per contract + ongoing governance
Volume: Collection-site / DOH-accredited lab / MRO vendor relationship
Owner: Procurement (VS-34) / Occupational Health (VS-83) / HR
Participants: Procurement (VS-34), Occupational Health (VS-83), HR (VS-103), Legal (VS-100), Compliance (VS-22), Privacy (VS-91), Finance (VS-17.4)
Source: workflow W4460 — Drug Testing Vendor (Collection/Lab/MRO) Selection &amp; Contract</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4460_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4460_Lane1" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4460_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4460_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4460_Lane2" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4460_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4460_Lane3" name="Occupational Health">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4460_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4460_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4460_Start5" name="Vendor contracting; renewal; underperformance">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4460_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4460_Task6" name="DOH-accredited">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Procurement/Occupational Health select DOH-accredited drug-testing laboratory, collection sites/clinic, and a Medical Review Officer (MRO), verifying accreditation, methodology, chain-of-custody, turnaround, and data security
Responsible (R): Procurement / Occupational Health / Compliance
Accountable (A): CHRO / Compliance Lead / VP Legal
Duration: Per contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4460_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4460_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4460_Task7" name="chain-of-custody">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal/Privacy contract the vendor with SLA, chain-of-custody terms, confidentiality/RA 10173 data-protection, accreditation-maintenance, audit rights, and breach consequence
Responsible (R): Legal / Privacy / Procurement
Accountable (A): VP Legal / CHRO
Duration: Per contract</bpmn:documentation>
