      <bpmn:userTask id="W4462_Task5" name="DPO/Legal/Occupational Health set the consent &amp; lawful-basis framework —…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DPO/Legal/Occupational Health set the consent &amp; lawful-basis framework — informed consent per test, sensitive-data (health) handling under RA 10173, purpose limitation (employment/health/safety), and access restriction
Responsible (R): DPO / Legal / Occupational Health
Accountable (A): DPO / VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4462_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
