        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: HR/Occupational Health/Vendor handle results confidentially — restricted access (need-to-know), secure storage/transfer, retention (VS-88), and DSAR handling (VS-91)
Responsible (R): HR / Occupational Health / Vendor / DPO
Accountable (A): CHRO / DPO
Duration: Per test</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4462_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4462_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
