        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DPO/Compliance audit privacy compliance, manage any breach (VS-91.3), and ensure labor-lawfulness of results use (due process W4471, VS-84)
Responsible (R): DPO / Compliance / Legal
Accountable (A): DPO / VP Legal
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4462_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4462_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
