      <bpmn:userTask id="W4464_Task5" name="HR/EA/IT design the data architecture — testing records (consent W4462, result…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: HR/EA/IT design the data architecture — testing records (consent W4462, result, MRO, chain-of-custody), safety-sensitive flag (W4459), case management (W4471), EAP/referral (W4473), with restricted access &amp; integration to HRIS (VS-103)/occupational-health (VS-83)
Responsible (R): HR / EA / IT / Occupational Health
Accountable (A): CIO / CHRO
Duration: Per lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4464_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4464_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4464_Task6" name="IT/Privacy implement with health-data sensitivity (RA 10173), secure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: IT/Privacy implement with health-data sensitivity (RA 10173), secure evidence/records retention (VS-88), SoD, and integration to compliance (VS-22)/legal (VS-100)
Responsible (R): IT / Privacy / Legal
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Per deployment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4464_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4464_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4464_Task7" name="HR/IT govern the platform, drive analytics (W4478), and optimize on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: HR/IT govern the platform, drive analytics (W4478), and optimize on adoption/cost (VS-135)
Responsible (R): HR / IT / BI
Accountable (A): CHRO / CIO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4464_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4464_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
