        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-680 (ensure controlled execution — Drug-Free Workplace Policy, Framework &amp; DOLE Compliance (PA-150.1).) | - CTL-680: architecture security-assessed (VS-27.3); health-data privacy-by-design (VS-91); SoD; records retained (VS-88); cost governed (VS-135)
Owner: HR/IT (VS-27/VS-103) / EA (VS-113) / Occupational Health (VS-83)</bpmn:text>
